## English

### Software Engineer

I design web applications and intelligent systems, from Python backends to user interfaces. My current work focuses on AI-augmented document management systems (RAG) and on the software quality of an electronic ticketing platform.

Based in Tunis, Tunisia. I work in French and English.

### Currently

- **Final-year engineering project, DocRAG**: a multi-tenant SaaS document management application with a RAG chatbot that lets users query their documents in natural language. Deployed to production on an OVH VPS (Nginx, SSL).
- **Tick8ing, Tunis**: Software Tester & Technical Support since October 2025. Functional testing, bug ticket writing, Angular component development and technical documentation.

### Skills

| Area | Technologies |
| --- | --- |
| Backend | Python, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, pytest |
| Frontend | React, Vite, Angular, PrimeNG |
| Mobile | Flutter, Riverpod, GoRouter |
| AI and RAG | LangChain, Ollama, Mistral, LanceDB, HuggingFace embeddings |
| Data | SQL, MySQL, SQLite |
| Infrastructure | Docker, Docker Compose, Linux, Nginx, OVH, LDAP |
| Quality | Functional testing, bug tickets, automated testing |
| Embedded and IoT | Embedded systems, IoT, FPGA and Verilog |

### Projects

#### DocRAG, intelligent document management (final-year project)

Multi-tenant SaaS application with one SQLite database per client, a RAG chatbot, LDAP and JWT authentication, automated tests with pytest and a containerized deployment.

Stack: FastAPI, LanceDB, Ollama (Mistral), Angular, Docker Compose.

#### Training and revision platform

Student area (courses, revision sheets, graded quizzes, progress tracking) and an administration back office.

Stack: React, FastAPI, Supabase, Render, Netlify.

#### Point-of-sale system for the Tunisian market

Point-of-sale application adapted to local needs: Tunisian dinars and VAT handling.

Stack: FastAPI, React, Vite.

#### MeetUp Friends

Mobile app for organizing events with friends, with real-time messaging over WebSocket.

Stack: Flutter, Riverpod, GoRouter, FastAPI.

#### Site generators

A Python generator for Angular sites (routing, themes) and a no-code page builder with live preview and HTML export.

Stack: Python, Angular, Streamlit.

